Here's the problem file for turning on the mobile phone:

```
(define (problem turn_on_phone_problem)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    CellPhone - object
    Desk - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot2 Desk)
    (at-location CellPhone Desk)
    (not (inaction robot2))
    (switch-off robot2 CellPhone)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (switch-on robot2 CellPhone)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.